{"id":"69ebe15818f1e306","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-thm-measure.md","title":"Measurable-Cardinal Ultrapower","display":"thm-measure — Measurable-Cardinal Ultrapower","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-measure","aliases":["58-thm-measure"],"display":"thm-measure — Measurable-Cardinal Ultrapower","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-measurable-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-kappa-complete.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-nonprincipal.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-lc-measurable-cardinal-ultrafilter.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-largecard2-ultrapower-embedding.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-measure — Measurable-Cardinal Ultrapower"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b4fb7c1808c84d14\" href=\"?note=b4fb7c1808c84d14\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-measurable-cardinal.md\">../batch06/58-df-measurable-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ae8ff2952a475545\" href=\"?note=ae8ff2952a475545\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-kappa-complete.md\">../batch16/58-df-kappa-complete.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3e4a39dd9e2f4f00\" href=\"?note=3e4a39dd9e2f4f00\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-nonprincipal.md\">../batch15/58-df-nonprincipal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" href=\"?note=a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md\">../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9f20a389e87b9d76\" href=\"?note=9f20a389e87b9d76\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-lc-measurable-cardinal-ultrafilter.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-lc-measurable-cardinal-ultrafilter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f460beb1fd828d35\" href=\"?note=f460beb1fd828d35\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-largecard2-ultrapower-embedding.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-largecard2-ultrapower-embedding.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span> (measurable-cardinal predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLcMeasurableCardinalUltrafilter}_S(\\kappa,U)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLcMeasurableCardinalUltrafilter}_S(\\kappa,U)\\)</span> (normal measure witness)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2UltrapowerEmbedding}_S(j,M,U,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2UltrapowerEmbedding}_S(j,M,U,\\kappa)\\)</span> (class-level ultrapower embedding)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}measure}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\forall\\kappa\\;\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(\\kappa)\n\\to\n\\exists U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\;\\exists_{\\mathsf{Class}}M,j_U\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcMeasurableCardinalUltrafilter}_S(\\kappa,U)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2UltrapowerEmbedding}_S(j_U,M,U,\\kappa)\n\\land j_U(\\kappa)\\ne\\kappa\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(j_U(\\alpha)=\\alpha)\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}measure}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\forall\\kappa\\;\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(\\kappa)\n\\to\n\\exists U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\;\\exists_{\\mathsf{Class}}M,j_U\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcMeasurableCardinalUltrafilter}_S(\\kappa,U)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2UltrapowerEmbedding}_S(j_U,M,U,\\kappa)\n\\land j_U(\\kappa)\\ne\\kappa\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(j_U(\\alpha)=\\alpha)\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-completeness makes the ultrapower well-founded, after taking its transitive collapse.</li>\n<li>The critical-point conclusion is the nontrivial theorem-level consequence beyond the defining existence of the measure.</li>\n<li>The ultrapower target and embedding are proper classes and are therefore quantified in the metatheory; the set-coded elementary-embedding predicate is not applied to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-measurable-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"b4fb7c1808c84d14","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-measurable-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-kappa-complete.md","status":"resolved","id":"ae8ff2952a475545","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-kappa-complete.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-nonprincipal.md","status":"resolved","id":"3e4a39dd9e2f4f00","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-nonprincipal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"a25c0a66cf56c0f4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-lc-measurable-cardinal-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"9f20a389e87b9d76","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-lc-measurable-cardinal-ultrafilter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-largecard2-ultrapower-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"f460beb1fd828d35","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-largecard2-ultrapower-embedding.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLcMeasurableCardinalUltrafilter}_S(\\kappa,U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2UltrapowerEmbedding}_S(j,M,U,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}measure}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\forall\\kappa\\;\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(\\kappa)\n\\to\n\\exists U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\;\\exists_{\\mathsf{Class}}M,j_U\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcMeasurableCardinalUltrafilter}_S(\\kappa,U)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2UltrapowerEmbedding}_S(j_U,M,U,\\kappa)\n\\land j_U(\\kappa)\\ne\\kappa\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(j_U(\\alpha)=\\alpha)\n\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":1680,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4310","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-thm-measure.md|58-thm-measure]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["b4fb7c1808c84d14","5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","ae8ff2952a475545","3e4a39dd9e2f4f00","a25c0a66cf56c0f4","9f20a389e87b9d76","f460beb1fd828d35"]}